# Testing

- Phase 0: `pnpm exec tsc --noEmit` and `pnpm run build` must pass
- Prefer tests that lock critical user journeys over broad snapshot churn
- When backend lands: unit tests for scoring/coverage pure logic; API tests for authz and publish gate
- Integration tests for Jira/ADO should use recorded fixtures or sandboxes — never real customer PATs in CI
- Keep one-replica SQLite constraints covered in deploy config tests when added
- Do not block Phase 0 on a full test harness
